{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KILL. DIE. LEARN. LvL50 is a fast-paced first-person shooter where you need to beat 50 levels, in a row, without getting hit. Can you become a master and escape the lab?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo includes the first 15 levels of the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ONE LIFE IS ALL YOU NEED</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 15 levels are consistent every time you play, meaning you're not going in blind every run. Every enemy will be in the same spot every run, and you can scrap them as efficiently as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/674081d21d778cb64bd6f4f6fa034036.poster.avif?t=1760460864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/674081d21d778cb64bd6f4f6fa034036.webm?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/674081d21d778cb64bd6f4f6fa034036.mp4?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>MOVE FAST, THINK FASTER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With quick movement, you can go anywhere you want to in just a few seconds. In the dangerous environments of the levels, however, one wrong move can send you back to the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/0c8463b8a70b121eab11089870b6817e.poster.avif?t=1760460864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/0c8463b8a70b121eab11089870b6817e.webm?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/0c8463b8a70b121eab11089870b6817e.mp4?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>GET THE PERFECT TIME</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your time beating the levels is being tracked and uploaded to friend leaderboards, so a run that doesn't make it to the end can still be successful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/50c3ba80f162cf03e9bef9e99e786b25.poster.avif?t=1760460864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/50c3ba80f162cf03e9bef9e99e786b25.webm?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827690/extras/50c3ba80f162cf03e9bef9e99e786b25.mp4?t=1760460864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's about time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827690/2f2896db84ce5ddbcbf4a027c399d4cb745255b9.jpg"},{"name":"Natural Talent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827690/2a271300889d9bd951a40a81b683192be4686b87.jpg"},{"name":"Hired Potassium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827690/cef6c3bf5e3888b6f279f61f3b0515a89e0a23d0.jpg"},{"name":"Tourist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3827690/3c653ccc31be49fe19c1f4b1ada59df65ce50488.jpg"},{"name":"Promoted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/